Subject: 5m prompt cache TTL for orchestrator-spawned Claude agents
Decision: parented Claude agents created via create_agent default featureValues.prompt_cache_ttl=5m; explicit caller value wins verbatim; non-parented and non-Claude agents untouched; buildOptions maps the value onto the SDK env via CLAUDE_CODE_PROMPT_CACHE_TTL (5m/1h set it, default/missing/invalid unset, user env wins); prompt_cache_ttl select feature visible only when stamped; setFeature validates against default/5m/1h
